{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794229116,"nonce":"tUMYjY98MuFqyRMdc66d1uwkKu0=","title":"A flexible resizable panel takes its content's width as its basis","message":"The flexible panel wrapper had `flex-basis: auto`, so wide content (long code\nlines in a tab) grew it and shrank the fixed panels beside it. In the russl\ntoy, opening the WGSL tab narrowed the console panel.\n\nFix: the wrapper is `flex: \u003cgrow\u003e 1 0`, so it shares only the space the fixed\npanels leave. Test\n`wide_content_in_the_flexible_panel_leaves_the_fixed_one_its_size`.","files":null}]}